Package: xbrlstatements
Title: Build Financial Statements from SEC XBRL Filings
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph", "Bennett", , "jbennett@jbennettconsulting.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds income statements, balance sheets and cash flow
     statements from SEC XBRL filings by walking presentation linkbase
     trees and selecting consolidated and dimensional facts.
